# Repository memory

`MEMORY.md` is the living record of this repo. Update it in the same session whenever you change code, routes, or docs.

- Record only what `git log`, `git status`, and the files show. Do not invent commits.
- New or wired routes go in the **Live App Router endpoints** table.
- Uncommitted work stays under **Current tree**. After a commit, move that work into **Commit history**.
- Bump **Last updated** and **HEAD** on every edit.
- Do not commit secrets, screenshots, or `.playwright-mcp/`.
